18. AdSense operations and policy readiness

AdSense is a primary monetization objective.

Add an operational configuration view for the existing ad integration.

Show:

Whether a publisher ID is configured.

Whether ad components are enabled.

Which placements are active.

Which placements are development-only.

Whether required policy and privacy pages exist.

